872
01:13:08,189 --> 01:13:09,590
Tidak apa-apa, Janine.

873
01:13:11,359 --> 01:13:12,627
Aku merasa tenang.

874
01:13:15,162 --> 01:13:16,597
Tidak... hei. Hei.

875
01:13:17,365 --> 01:13:18,633
Dan, Stanley.

876
01:13:20,500 --> 01:13:22,270
